{"id":"871fa7428f3b8459","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-compact-manifold.md","title":"Compact Manifold","display":"df-compact-manifold — Compact Manifold","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-compact-manifold","aliases":["58-df-compact-manifold","Compact Manifold"],"display":"df-compact-manifold — Compact Manifold","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-compactness.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-compact-manifold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-compact-manifold</span><span>Compact Manifold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compact-manifold — Compact Manifold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aae2069870df29cb\" href=\"?note=aae2069870df29cb\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-compactness.md\">../batch06/58-df-compactness.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau\\in V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\)</span>（拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-流形，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compactness}_S(M,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compactness}_S(M,\\tau)\\)</span>（关于同一拓扑的紧致性谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aae2069870df29cb\" href=\"?note=aae2069870df29cb\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-compactness.md\">../batch06/58-df-compactness.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact-manifold} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{Compactness}_S(M,\\tau)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact-manifold} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{Compactness}_S(M,\\tau)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A compact manifold is compact in its intrinsic manifold topology; “closed and bounded” is only an ambient Euclidean characterization after a suitable embedding.</li>\n<li>Hopf-Rinow identifies metric completeness, geodesic completeness, and compactness of closed bounded subsets for connected Riemannian manifolds; it does not make every complete manifold compact.</li>\n<li>Poincaré duality: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^k(M) \\cong H^{n-k}(M)\">\\(H^k(M) \\cong H^{n-k}(M)\\)</span> for compact orientable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span></li>\n<li>Classification: 1D and 2D compact manifolds fully classified; higher dimensions open problems</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Milnor, Topology from the Differential Viewpoint</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-compactness.md","status":"resolved","id":"aae2069870df29cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-compactness.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)$（拓扑 $n$-流形，see [[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-compactness.md","status":"resolved","id":"aae2069870df29cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compactness}_S(M,\\tau)$（关于同一拓扑的紧致性谓词，see [[../batch06/58-df-compactness.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compactness}_S(M,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact-manifold} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{Compactness}_S(M,\\tau)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"H^k(M) \\cong H^{n-k}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1516,"backlinks":[{"id":"b80ea50ccf56b0ca","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e06256d3696011c6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8b69e35947998